{"parts":[{"function_response":{"name":"tavily_search","response":{"result":"[{'title': 'The Story of the Moon Landings Book | Historic Newspapers', 'url': 'https://www.historic-newspapers.com/products/the-story-of-the-moon-landings?srsltid=AfmBOoqNIClOD9IbLX-zBOE8mK2yZTXsUWiHnQQm72djCEhaGUx5qgyF', 'content': 'Follow the story of the Apollo 11 Moon landing through a book of authentic newspaper articles, curated from original reports dating back to 1969. This edition charts humanity’s giant leap — exactly as it was reported at the time.\\n\\nFeaturing:\\n\\n– The launch of Apollo 11 aboard the Saturn V rocket from Kennedy Space Center  \\n– Minute-by-minute coverage of the Eagle lunar module landing on the Moon  \\n– Neil Armstrong’s first steps and his iconic words, “That’s one small step for man…”  \\n– The historic return to Earth and worldwide celebrations  \\n– A full replica of the 1969 newspaper reporting the Moon landing [...] POD book titled \"The Story of the Moon Landings\" by Historic Newspapers, featuring a black-and-white cover with lunar landing imagery.\\nA POD book titled \"The Story of the Moon Landings\" by Historic Newspapers, featuring a white cover with space-themed design.\\nA POD book titled \"The Story of the Moon Landings\" by Historic Newspapers, featuring a white cover with space-themed design.\\nA printed copy of \"The Story of the Moon Landings\" POD book by Historic Newspapers, featuring a black cover with space-themed design.\\nPOD book titled \"The Story of the Moon Landings\" by Historic Newspapers, featuring a black cover with space and moon landing imagery.\\n\\nThe Story of the Moon Landings Book FAQs [...] Historic Newspapers premium gift box add-on, featuring vintage newspaper designs with festive Christmas themes.', 'score': 0.9998795}, {'title': 'Moon Landing: The Incredible Story of the Apollo 11 ...', 'url': 'https://wakefieldbooks.com/book/9798217134151', 'content': \"A gripping, action-packed narrative with historical accuracy that allows readers to deep-dive into the Apollo 11 mission and those historic first footsteps.\\n Atmospheric illustrations that give a moody graphic novel vibe, perfect for kids ages 9-12.\\n Accessible STEM learning through light-touch diagrams and science explanations that reveal how the mission was made possible.\\n\\nThe perfect gift for young space lovers, Moon Landing is a must-have space adventure book that will inspire you to look at the stars and imagine the impossible.  \\n  \\nMore in the series  \\nExplore more of the greatest moments in science history, told as exciting adventure stories with DK Science Stories. Next, discover the gripping true story of the world’s first antibiotic in Project Penicillin.\\n\\n## About the Author [...] Welcome to our new website! We're excited to see you. \\\\\\\\\\\\ RETURNING USERS WILL NEED TO RESET THEIR PASSWORD FOR THIS NEW SITE. CLICK HERE TO RESET YOUR PASSWORD.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\nClose this alert\\n\\nWakefield Books   \\n 160 Old Tower Hill Road   \\n Wakefield, RI 02879 (401) 792-0000\\n\\nWakefield Books\\n\\nNew Release\\n\\nMoon Landing: The Incredible Story of the Apollo 11 Mission (DK Science Stories)\\n\\n# Moon Landing: The Incredible Story of the Apollo 11 Mission (DK Science Stories)\\n\\nStephen Krensky\\n\\nCurrent price:  $12.99\\n\\nPublish Date:\\n\\nPublisher:\\n\\nDK Children\\n\\nISBN:\\n\\n9798217134151\\n\\nPages:\\n\\n96\\n\\nAge Range:\\n\\n9 - 12\\n\\nGrade Range:\\n\\n4 - 7\\n\\nLanguage:\\n\\nEnglish\\n\\nStock Information\\n\\nWakefield Books - 2 on hand, as of Mar 25 9:13pm\\n\\n(CHILDRENS EDUCATION)\\n\\nOn Our Shelves Now\\n\\n## Description [...] (CHILDRENS EDUCATION)\\n\\nOn Our Shelves Now\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nExperience the historic Apollo 11 mission from Earth to the moon in this gripping space adventure for kids ages 9-12.  \\n  \\nStep back in time to July 16, 1969, and relive the thrill of the moon landing alongside Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin as they go where no one has ever been before. This is the story of the legendary Apollo 11 mission, humanity’s oldest dream – and everyone who made it happen.   \\n  \\nLearn all about one of the greatest moments in science history in this exciting, fast-paced narrative, from President Kennedy’s bold challenge to the breathtaking moment that humans first walked on the lunar surface.  \\n  \\nJoin the crew and discover:\", 'score': 0.9967013}, {'title': 'Picturing Apollo 11 Book - The Space Shop', 'url': 'https://thespaceshop.com/picturing-apollo-11-book/', 'content': 'Picturing Apollo 11 is an unprecedented photographic history of the space mission that defined an era. Through a wealth of unpublicized and recently discovered images, this book presents new and rarely-seen views of the people, places, and events involved in the pioneering first moon landing of July 20, 1969. [...] Most of the photographs were selected from NASA archives and the collection of J. L. Pickering, which is the world\\'s largest private collection of U.S. human space flight images. The accompanying text by veteran space correspondent John Bisney details the scenes, revealing the astonishing scale and scope of activities that went into planning and executing the first moon landing. This book commemorates the historic mission and evokes the electric atmosphere of the time. [...] No other book has showcased as many never-before-seen photos connected with Apollo 11, or as many photos covering the activities from months before to years after the mission. Starting with the extensive preparations, these images show astronauts Neil Armstrong, Michael Collins, and Buzz Aldrin training for the flight, as well as the stages of the massive Saturn V rocket arriving at the Kennedy Space Center for assembly. They capture the media frenzy over the unfolding story and the \"moon fever\" that gripped the nation.', 'score': 0.99497885}, {'title': 'The Best Books About the Apollo Program and Landing on ...', 'url': 'https://www.smithsonianmag.com/science-nature/best-books-about-apollo-program-and-landing-moon-180972653/', 'content': 'The story of venturing to the moon does not begin with Apollo, Neil Armstrong or even President John F. Kennedy. Before any human could venture nearly a quarter million miles to another world, the spaceflights of the Mercury program took the first Americans to space, and the Gemini program tested many of the technologies necessary for a lunar voyage, such as docking two spacecraft together and crawling out of a spacecraft in nothing but a pressure suit. Apollo: The Race to the Moon by Charles Murray and Catherine Bly Cox tells this story primarily through the lens of the NASA managers, scientists and engineers who made the moon landing possible. “Murray and Cox provide a ground-level, engineering view of the Mercury, Gemini and Apollo programs,” Neufeld says. “[Their book] paints a vivid [...] The story of venturing to the moon does not begin with Apollo, Neil Armstrong or even President John F. Kennedy. Before any human could venture nearly a quarter million miles to another world, the spaceflights of the Mercury program took the first Americans to space, and the Gemini program tested many of the technologies necessary for a lunar voyage, such as docking two spacecraft together and crawling out of a spacecraft in nothing but a pressure suit. Apollo: The Race to the Moon by Charles Murray and Catherine Bly Cox tells this story primarily through the lens of the NASA managers, scientists and engineers who made the moon landing possible. “Murray and Cox provide a ground-level, engineering view of the Mercury, Gemini and Apollo programs,” Neufeld says. “[Their book] paints a vivid [...] Earthrise: How Man First Saw the Earth by Robert Poole, a former editor at Smithsonian, explores the significance of this photo and other images of Earth taken from space. Filled with beautiful pictures and stories from missions to the moon, the book delves into the impact of the Apollo program on everything from environmentalism to religion to science. “Poole’s story is one of ancient and academic ideas of the moon and the Earth, and how astronaut photographs like Earthrisefrom Apollo 8 became a primary means by which people would fulfill dreams of lunar travel and come to realize the scientific reality of the Earth-moon system,” says Jennifer Levasseur, a curator in the Smithsonian’s National Air and Space Museum’s space history department.', 'score': 0.99361163}, {'title': 'Moon Landing by Stephen Krensky', 'url': 'https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/812345/moon-landing-by-stephen-krensky/', 'content': 'Listen With the Whole Family\\n\\nView All  >\\n\\nNew Stories to Listen to\\n10 Audiobook Originals You Need To Hear\\nsearch\\nPenguin Random House\\nPenguin Random House\\nPenguin Random House\\nSign In\\nsearch\\nclose search\\nclose search\\nMoon Landing by Stephen Krensky\\n\\n# Moon Landing\\n\\nThe Incredible Story of the Apollo 11 Mission\\n\\n## By Stephen KrenskyRead by René Valius\\n\\n### Age Range: 9-12 years\\n\\nMoon Landing by Stephen Krensky\\n\\nBuy from Other Retailers:\\n\\nPublished on Mar 24, 2026 | 2 Hours\\n\\nBuy from Other Retailers:\\n\\n### Book Description\\n\\n#### Related Genres\\n\\n### Product Details\\n\\nISBN9798217139675\\n\\nPublished onMar 24, 2026\\n\\nPublished byDK Children\\n\\nLength2 Hours\\n\\nAge Range9-12 years\\n\\nGradeGrades 4-7\\n\\nAuthor\\n\\nStephen Krensky [...] ### Who Was Cleopatra?\\n\\nQUICK VIEW\\nAdd Who Is \"Weird Al\" Yankovic? to bookshelf\\nBook cover\\n\\n### Who Is “Weird Al” Yankovic?\\n\\nAdd Who Is Jenna Ortega? to bookshelf\\nBook cover\\n\\n### Who Is Jenna Ortega?\\n\\nAdd ¡Viva Valenzuela! to bookshelf\\nBook cover\\n\\n### ¡Viva Valenzuela!\\n\\nAdd World Soccer Kings to bookshelf\\nBook cover\\n\\n### World Soccer Kings\\n\\nAdd Sports: How to Draw Books for Kids to bookshelf\\nBook cover\\n\\n### Sports: How to Draw Books for Kids\\n\\nAdd Moon Landing to bookshelf\\nBook cover\\n\\n### Moon Landing\\n\\nMoon Landing by Stephen Krensky\\nClose excerpt\\nMoon Landing by Stephen Krensky\\n\\nConnect\\n\\nSign up for news about books, authors, and more from Penguin Random House\\n\\n© 2026 Penguin Random House\\n\\nConnect\\n\\nSign up for news about books, authors, and more from Penguin Random House', 'score': 0.9912209}]"}}}],"role":"user"}
