 the second revolution.\\n(See Table I-I for burn data).\\n2.\', \'score\': 0.5463757}, {\'title\': \'Apollo 11\', \'url\': \'https://www.nasa.gov/mission/apollo-11/\', \'content\': \'Apollo Program\\n\\n   The Apollo Program\\n   Missions\\n       Apollo 1\\n       Apollo 4\\n       Apollo 5\\n       Apollo 6\\n       Apollo 7\\n       Apollo 8\\n       Apollo 9\\n       Apollo 10\\n       Apollo 11\\n       Apollo 12\\n       Apollo 13\\n       Apollo 14\\n       Apollo 15\\n       Apollo 16\\n       Apollo 17\\n\\nImage 37: apollo_11_patch\\n\\n# Apollo 11\\n\\nOccurred 57 years ago\\n\\nThe primary objective of Apollo 11 was to complete a national goal set by President John F. Kennedy on May 25, 1961: perform a crewed lunar landing and return to Earth.\\n\\nMission Type\\n\\nLunar Landing\\n\\nastronauts\\n\\nNeil Armstrong, Buzz Aldrin, Michael Collins\\n\\nLaunch\\n\\nJuly 16, 1969\\n\\nSPLASHDOWN\\n\\nJuly 24, 1969\', \'score\': 0.50959414}]'
